<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="kk">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Компьютерлер қалай үйренеді?</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px 14px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #edf5ee;
      color: #183b36;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 42px);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    p { line-height: 1.6; }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #183b3614;
    }

    .top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    progress {
      width: 100%;
      height: 14px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      accent-color: #34735e;
    }

    #icon { font-size: 48px; }

    h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    button {
      font: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      min-height: 54px;
    }

    button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #1673b8;
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .answer {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 12px 0;
      text-align: left;
      color: #183b36;
      background: #f8faf6;
      border: 2px solid #dce5d9;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .answer:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: #edf5e8;
      border-color: #34735e;
    }

    .answer:disabled {
      opacity: 1;
      cursor: default;
    }

    .correct {
      background: #e3f5e4;
      border-color: #328342;
    }

    .wrong {
      background: #fff0e9;
      border-color: #b25333;
    }

    #feedback {
      padding: 16px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background: #eef5e9;
      border-radius: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .primary {
      background: #234e47;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    #total {
      font-size: 44px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #846015;
    }

    #review { padding-left: 24px; }
    #review li { margin: 18px 0; line-height: 1.6; }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: #526c5d;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    [hidden] { display: none !important; }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .card { padding: 20px; }
      h2 { font-size: 21px; }
      .answer { font-size: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <p>2-сынып · 31-тақырып</p>
  <h1>🤖 Компьютерлер қалай үйренеді?</h1>
  <p>Сұрақтарға жауап беріп, жұлдыз жина! Әр дұрыс жауапқа — 1 жұлдыз.</p>

  <noscript>
    <p>Ойын үшін браузерде JavaScript қосулы болуы керек.</p>
  </noscript>

  <section id="game" class="card" hidden>
    <div class="top">
      <span id="counter"></span>
      <span id="score">⭐ 0</span>
    </div>

    <progress id="progress" value="0" max="8"
              aria-label="Жауап берілген сұрақтар"></progress>

    <div id="icon" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <h2 id="question" tabindex="-1"></h2>
    <div id="answers"></div>

    <div id="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    <button id="next" class="primary" type="button" hidden>
      Келесі сұрақ →
    </button>
  </section>
